  "keyFeatures": [
    "Bolna.ai outbound voice call triggering and webhook tool integration",
    "Streaming LLM chat using Google Gemini 2.5 Flash via LiteLLM",
    "Hybrid RAG pipeline with pgvector semantic search across documents, chat history, and attachments",
    "Multi-format document ingestion (PDF, DOCX, XLSX, CSV, images) with auto-embedding",
    "JWT-based authentication with role-based access control (RBAC)",
    "Customisable prompt-template system for persona, safety, and response quality",
    "Per-user token usage tracking and configurable token limits",
    "LLM-powered natural language product search for voice agent tools"
  ],
